    "Fibrinogen",
    "Platelets"
  ],
  "features": "per variable: last, min, max, mean and number of hours with a value recorded by the cut-off; Age, Gender, Unit1, Unit2 and HospAdmTime as recorded (missing left to the learner); ICULOS, record length and SepsisLabel are not features",
  "learner": "models.fit_gbdt (HistGradientBoosting, max_depth 3, lr 0.06, 300 iter, l2 1.0, seed 0); scikit-learn's early_stopping='auto' is active because n_train > 10,000 (iterations used reported per design); columns never observed in training are dropped before fitting",
  "bootstrap": "patient-level paired percentile bootstrap, 1000 resamples, seed 0",
